<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  Autenticação.gov application, Qt 6.

  Qt 6 has no prebuilt 32-bit MSVC binaries, so the application is built for x64 only:
  the x86 installer ships the middleware without it.

  Environment (set_path_autenticacao.gov.bat):
    PTEID_DIR_QT_6_X64   Qt 6 for MSVC x64, e.g. C:\Qt\6.10.1\msvc2022_64
    PTEID_POPPLER_QT6    poppler built with ENABLE_QT6 (CMake install prefix: include, lib, bin)
-->
